  "aboutParagraphs": [
    "Harry Myers 2.0 is the John Houck-designed gem of Rockwall — a long course in a well-maintained park with short and long holes, wooded and open stretches, and real elevation. From the standard pins it plays 5,912 feet at par 64, with three par 5s giving the big arms room.",
    "Free to play with concrete tees and DISCatcher baskets, it's the kind of course that rewards a full bag: placement on the par 4s, power on the par 5s, and accuracy everywhere in between.",
    "A proper Houck course — varied, fair, and never boring."
  ],
