  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 18 finishes Harry Myers at 311 feet — a par 3 that draws on everything the course has shown you: a line through the woods, a fair bit of elevation, and the calm to make the putt. It's the kind of closer that makes a good round feel complete.",
